#. Content of the 'Help HTML' (HTML) field in DocType 'Document Naming
#. Settings'
#: frappe/core/doctype/document_naming_settings/document_naming_settings.json:41
#, python-brace-format
msgid "<div class=\"well\">\n"
"    Edit list of Series in the box. Rules:\n"
"    <ul>\n"
"        <li>Each Series Prefix on a new line.</li>\n"
"        <li>Allowed special characters are \"/\" and \"-\"</li>\n"
"        <li>\n"
"            Optionally, set the number of digits in the series using dot (.)\n"
"            followed by hashes (#). For example, \".####\" means that the series\n"
"            will have four digits. Default is five digits.\n"
"        </li>\n"
"        <li>\n"
"            You can also use variables in the series name by putting them\n"
"            between (.) dots\n"
"            <br>\n"
"            Supported Variables:\n"
"            <ul>\n"
"                <li><code>.YYYY.</code> - Year in 4 digits</li>\n"
"                <li><code>.YY.</code> - Year in 2 digits</li>\n"
"                <li><code>.MM.</code> - Month</li>\n"
"                <li><code>.DD.</code> - Day of month</li>\n"
"                <li><code>.WW.</code> - Week of the year</li>\n"
"                <li>\n"
"                    <code>.{fieldname}.</code> - fieldname on the document e.g.\n"
"                    <code>branch</code>\n"
"                </li>\n"
"                <li><code>.FY.</code> - Fiscal Year (requires ERPNext to be installed)</li>\n"
"                <li><code>.ABBR.</code> - Company Abbreviation (requires ERPNext to be installed)</li>\n"
"            </ul>\n"
"        </li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"    Examples:\n"
"    <ul>\n"
"        <li>INV-</li>\n"
"        <li>INV-10-</li>\n"
"        <li>INVK-</li>\n"
"        <li>INV-.YYYY.-.{branch}.-.MM.-.####</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<br>\n"
msgstr "<div class=\"well\">\n"
" Redaguokite lauke esantį serijos sąrašą. Taisyklės:\n"
" <ul>\n"
" <li>Kiekvienos serijos priešdėlis naujoje eilutėje.</li>\n"
" <li>Leistini specialieji simboliai yra \"/\" ir \"-\"</li>\n"
" <li>\n"
" Pasirinktinai nustatykite serijos skaitmenų skaičių, naudodami tašką (.)\n"
", po kurio seka hash (#). Pavyzdžiui, \".####\" reiškia, kad serija\n"
" turės keturis skaitmenis. Numatytoji reikšmė yra penki skaitmenys.\n"
" </li>\n"
" <li>\n"
" Serijos pavadinime taip pat galite naudoti kintamuosius, įterpdami juos\n"
" tarp (.) taškų\n"
" <br>\n"
" Palaikomi kintamieji:\n"
" <ul>\n"
" <li><code>.YYYYY.</kodas> - Metai 4 skaitmenimis</li>\n"
" <li><code>.YY.</kodas> - Metai 2 skaitmenimis</li>\n"
" <li><code>.MM.</kodas> - Mėnuo</li>\n"
" <li><code>.DD.</kodas> - Mėnesio diena</li>\n"
" <li><code>.WW.</kodas> - metų savaitė</li>\n"
" <li>\n"
" <kodas>.{fieldname}.</kodas> - dokumento lauko pavadinimas, pvz., \n"
" <kodas>branduolys</kodas>\n"
" </li>\n"
" <li><kodas>.FY.</kodas> - fiskaliniai metai (reikia įdiegti ERPNext)</li>\n"
" <li><kodas>.ABBR.</kodas> - įmonės santrumpa (reikia įdiegti ERPNext)</li>\n"
" </ul>\n"
" </li>\n"
" </ul>\n"
" </ul>\n"
" Pavyzdžiai:\n"
" <ul>\n"
" <li>INV-</li>\n"
" <li>INV-10-</li>\n"
" <li>INVK-</li>\n"
" <li>INV-.YYYY.-.{branch}.-.MM.-.####</li>\n"
" </ul>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<br>\n"

#. Content of the 'Custom HTML Help' (HTML) field in DocType 'Print Format'
#: frappe/printing/doctype/print_format/print_format.json:224
#, python-brace-format
msgid "<h3>Custom CSS Help</h3>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Notes:</p>\n"
"\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li>All field groups (label + value) are set attributes <code>data-fieldtype</code> and <code>data-fieldname</code></li>\n"
"<li>All values are given class <code>value</code></li>\n"
"<li>All Section Breaks are given class <code>section-break</code></li>\n"
"<li>All Column Breaks are given class <code>column-break</code></li>\n"
"</ol>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Examples</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>1. Left align integers</p>\n"
"\n"
"<pre><code>[data-fieldtype=\"Int\"] .value { text-align: left; }</code></pre>\n"
"\n"
"<p>1. Add border to sections except the last section</p>\n"
"\n"
"<pre><code>.section-break { padding: 30px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }\n"
".section-break:last-child { padding-bottom: 0px; border-bottom: 0px;  }</code></pre>\n"
msgstr "<h3>Custom CSS pagalba</h3>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Pastabos:</p>\n"
"\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li>Visoms laukų grupėms (etiketė + reikšmė) nustatomi atributai <code>data-fieldtype</code> ir <code>data-fieldname</code></li>\n"
"<li>Visoms reikšmėms suteikiama klasė <code>value</code></li>\n"
"<li>Visiems skirsnio pertrūkiams suteikiama klasė <code>section-break</code></li>\n"
"<li>Visiems stulpelių lūžiams suteikiama klasė <code>column-break</code></li>\n"
"</ol>\n"
"<h4>Pavyzdžiai</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>1. Svetimų skaičių lygiuotė į kairę</p>\n"
"\n"
"<pre><code>[data-fieldtype=\"Int\"] .value { text-align: left; }</code></pre>\n"
"\n"
"<p>1. Pridėkite apvadą skyriams, išskyrus paskutinį skyrių</p>\n"
"\n"
"<pre><code>.section-break { padding: 30px 0px; border-bottom: Padding-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }\n"
".section-break:last-child { padding-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }\n"
".section-break:last-child { padding-bottom: 0px; border-bottom: 0px; }</code></pre>\n"

#. Content of the 'Print Format Help' (HTML) field in DocType 'Print Format'
#: frappe/printing/doctype/print_format/print_format.json:236
#, python-format
msgid "<h3>Print Format Help</h3>\n"
"<hr>\n"
"<h4>Introduction</h4>\n"
"<p>Print Formats are rendered on the server side using the Jinja Templating Language. All forms have access to the <code>doc</code> object which contains information about the document that is being formatted. You can also access common utilities via the <code>frappe</code> module.</p>\n"
"<p>For styling, the Boostrap CSS framework is provided and you can enjoy the full range of classes.</p>\n"
"<hr>\n"
"<h4>References</h4>\n"
"<ol>\n"
"\t<li><a href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/templates/\" target=\"_blank\">Jinja Templating Language</a></li>\n"
"\t<li><a href=\"http://getbootstrap.com\" target=\"_blank\">Bootstrap CSS Framework</a></li>\n"
"</ol>\n"
"<hr>\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\n"
"<pre><code>&lt;h3&gt;{{ doc.select_print_heading or \"Invoice\" }}&lt;/h3&gt;\n"
"&lt;div class=\"row\"&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-3 text-right\"&gt;Customer Name&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-9\"&gt;{{ doc.customer_name }}&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;div class=\"row\"&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-3 text-right\"&gt;Date&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-9\"&gt;{{ doc.get_formatted(\"invoice_date\") }}&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;table class=\"table table-bordered\"&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;tbody&gt;\n"
"\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Sr&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Item Name&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Description&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Qty&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Rate&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Amount&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\n"
"\t\t{%- for row in doc.items -%}\n"
"\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 3%;\"&gt;{{ row.idx }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 20%;\"&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t\t{{ row.item_name }}\n"
"\t\t\t\t{% if row.item_code != row.item_name -%}\n"
"\t\t\t\t&lt;br&gt;Item Code: {{ row.item_code}}\n"
"\t\t\t\t{%- endif %}\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 37%;\"&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t\t&lt;div style=\"border: 0px;\"&gt;{{ row.description }}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 10%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{ row.qty }} {{ row.uom or row.stock_uom }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 15%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{\n"
"\t\t\t\trow.get_formatted(\"rate\", doc) }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 15%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{\n"
"\t\t\t\trow.get_formatted(\"amount\", doc) }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\n"
"\t\t{%- endfor -%}\n"
"\t&lt;/tbody&gt;\n"
"&lt;/table&gt;</code></pre>\n"
"<hr>\n"
"<h4>Common Functions</h4>\n"
"<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n"
"\t<tbody>\n"
"\t\t<tr>\n"
"\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 30%;\"><code>doc.get_formatted(\"[fieldname]\", [parent_doc])</code></td>\n"
"\t\t\t<td>Get document value formatted as Date, Currency, etc. Pass parent <code>doc</code> for currency type fields.</td>\n"
"\t\t</tr>\n"
"\t\t<tr>\n"
"\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 30%;\"><code>frappe.db.get_value(\"[doctype]\", \"[name]\", \"fieldname\")</code></td>\n"
"\t\t\t<td>Get value from another document.</td>\n"
"\t\t</tr>\n"
"\t</tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
msgstr "<h3>Spausdinimo formato pagalba</h3>\n"
"<hr>\n"
"<h4>Įvadas</h4>\n"
"<p>Spausdinimo formatai atvaizduojami serverio pusėje naudojant Jinja šablonavimo kalbą. Visos formos turi prieigą prie objekto <code>doc</code>, kuriame pateikiama informacija apie formatuojamą dokumentą. Taip pat galite pasiekti bendras pagalbines priemones naudodami modulį <code>frappe</code>.</p>\n"
"<p>Stiliaus formavimui suteikiama \"Boostrap\" CSS sistema, todėl galite naudotis visomis klasėmis.</p>\n"
"<hr>\n"
"<h4>Nuorodos</h4>\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li><a href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/templates/\" target=\"_blank\">Jinja šablonavimo kalba</a></li>\n"
"\t<li><a href=\"http://getbootstrap.com\" target=\"_blank\">Bootstrap CSS sistema</a></li>\n"
"</ol>\n"
"</ol>\n"
"<hr>\n"
"<h4>Pavyzdys</h4>\n"
"<pre><code>&lt;h3&gt;{{ doc.select_print_heading or \"Invoice\" }}&lt;/h3&gt;\n"
"&lt;div class=\"row\"&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-3 text-right\"&gt;Kliento pavadinimas&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-9\"&gt;{{ doc.customer_name }}&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;div class=\"row\"&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-3 text-right\"&gt;Date&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-9\"&gt;{{ doc.get_formatted(\"invoice_date\") }}&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;table class=\"table-bordered\"&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;tbody&gt;\n"
"\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\n"
"\t\t&lt;th&gt;Sr&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t&lt;th&gt;Prekės pavadinimas&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t&lt;th&gt;Aprašymas&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Kiekis&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Rate&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Amount&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\n"
"\t\t{%- for row in doc.items -%}\n"
"\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\n"
"\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 3%;\"&gt;{{ row.idx }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 20%;\"&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t\t{{ row.item_name }}\n"
"\t\t\t\t{% if row.item_code != row.item_name -%}\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;br&gt;Prekės kodas: {{ row.item_code}}\n"
"\t\t\t\t{%- endif %}\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 37%;\"&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;div style=\"border: 0px;\"&gt;{{ row.description }}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 10%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{ row.qty }} {{ row.uom arba row.stock_uom }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 15%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{\n"
"\t\t\t\t\trow.get_formatted(\"rate\", doc) }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 15%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{n\t\t\t\t\trow.get_formatted(\"amount\", doc) }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\n"
"\t\t{%- endfor -%}\n"
"\t&lt;/tbody&gt;\n"
"&lt;/table&gt;</code></pre>\n"
"<hr>\n"
"<h4>Bendrosios funkcijos</h4>\n"
"<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n"
"\t<tbody>\n"
"\t\t<tr>\n"
"\t\t<td style=\"width: 30%;\"><code>doc.get_formatted(\"[fieldname]\", [parent_doc])</code></td>\n"
"\t\t\t<td>Gauti dokumento vertę, suformatuotą kaip datą, valiutą ir pan. Valiutos tipo laukams perduokite pagrindinį <code>doc</code>.</td>\n"
"\t\t</tr>\n"
"\t\t<tr>\n"
"\t\t<td style=\"width: 30%;\"><code>frappe.db.get_value(\"[doctype]\", \"[name]\", \"fieldname\")</code></td>\n"
"\t\t\t<td>Gauti reikšmę iš kito dokumento.</td>\n"
"\t\t</tr>\n"
"\t</tr>\n"
"\t</tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</table>\n"

#. Description of the 'Template' (Code) field in DocType 'Address Template'
#: frappe/contacts/doctype/address_template/address_template.json:35
#, python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "<h4>Default Template</h4>\n"
"<p>Uses <a href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/templates/\">Jinja Templating</a> and all the fields of Address (including Custom Fields if any) will be available</p>\n"
"<pre><code>{{ address_line1 }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if address_line2 %}{{ address_line2 }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{{ city }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if state %}{{ state }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if pincode %} PIN:  {{ pincode }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{{ country }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if phone %}Phone: {{ phone }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if fax %}Fax: {{ fax }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if email_id %}Email: {{ email_id }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"</code></pre>"
msgstr "<h4>Numatytas šablonas</h4>\n"
"<p>Panaudoja <a href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/templates/\">Jinja šablonas</a> ir bus prieinami visi adreso laukai (įskaitant pasirinktinius laukus, jei tokių yra)</p>\n"
"<pre><code>{{ address_line1 }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if address_line2 %}{{ address_line2 }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{{ city }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if state %}{{ state }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if pincode %} PIN: {{ pincode }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{{ šalis }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if phone %}Telefonas: {{ phone }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if fax %}Faksas: {{ fax }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if email_id %}Email: {{ email_id }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"</code></pre>"

#. Content of the 'Email Reply Help' (HTML) field in DocType 'Email Template'
#: frappe/email/doctype/email_template/email_template.json:50
msgid "<h4>Email Reply Example</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<pre>Order Overdue\n"
"\n"
"Transaction {{ name }} has exceeded Due Date. Please take necessary action.\n"
"\n"
"Details\n"
"\n"
"- Customer: {{ customer }}\n"
"- Amount: {{ grand_total }}\n"
"</pre>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>How to get fieldnames</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>The fieldnames you can use in your email template are the fields in the document from which you are sending the email. You can find out the fields of any documents via Setup &gt; Customize Form View and selecting the document type (e.g. Sales Invoice)</p>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Templating</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Templates are compiled using the Jinja Templating Language. To learn more about Jinja, <a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/\">read this documentation.</a></p>\n"
msgstr "<h4>Elektroninio atsakymo pavyzdys</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<pre>Užsakymas pradelstas\n"
"\n"
"Transakcija {{ pavadinimas }} viršijo terminą. Prašome imtis reikiamų veiksmų.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Detalesnė informacija\n"
"\n"
"- Klientas: {{ klientas }}\n"
"- Suma: {Laukų pavadinimai, kuriuos galite naudoti el. pašto šablone, yra dokumento, iš kurio siunčiate el. laišką, laukai. Bet kurio dokumento laukus galite sužinoti naudodami Nustatyti &gt; Pritaikyti formos rodinį ir pasirinkę dokumento tipą (pvz., Pardavimo sąskaita faktūra)</p>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Šablonavimas</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Šablonai sudaromi naudojant Jinja šablonavimo kalbą. Norėdami daugiau sužinoti apie \"Jinja\", <a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/\">perskaitykite šią dokumentaciją.</a></p>\n"

#. Content of the 'Message Examples' (HTML) field in DocType 'Notification'
#: frappe/email/doctype/notification/notification.json:266
#, python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "<h5>Message Example</h5>\n"
"\n"
"<pre>&lt;h3&gt;Order Overdue&lt;/h3&gt;\n"
"\n"
"&lt;p&gt;Transaction {{ doc.name }} has exceeded Due Date. Please take necessary action.&lt;/p&gt;\n"
"\n"
"&lt;!-- show last comment --&gt;\n"
"{% if comments %}\n"
"Last comment: {{ comments[-1].comment }} by {{ comments[-1].by }}\n"
"{% endif %}\n"
"\n"
"&lt;h4&gt;Details&lt;/h4&gt;\n"
"\n"
"&lt;ul&gt;\n"
"&lt;li&gt;Customer: {{ doc.customer }}\n"
"&lt;li&gt;Amount: {{ doc.grand_total }}\n"
"&lt;/ul&gt;\n"
"</pre>"
msgstr "<h5>Pranešimo pavyzdys</h5>\n"
"\n"
"<pre>&lt;h3&gt;Užsakymas vėluoja&lt;/h3&gt;\n"
"\n"
"&lt;p&gt;Sandoris {{ doc.name }} viršijo terminą. Prašome imtis reikiamų veiksmų.&lt;/p&gt;\n"
"\n"
"&lt;!-- rodyti paskutinį komentarą --&gt;\n"
"{% if comments %}\n"
"Paskutinis komentaras: {{ comments[-1].comment }} iki {{ comments[-1].by }}\n"
"{% endif %}\n"
"\n"
"&lt;h4&gt;Details&lt;/h4&gt;\n"
"\n"
"&lt;ul&gt;\n"
"&lt;li&gt;Klientas: {{ doc.customer }}\n"
"&lt;li&gt;Suma: {{ doc.grand_total }}n&lt;/ul&gt;\n"
"</pre>"

#. Content of the 'html_7' (HTML) field in DocType 'Notification'
#: frappe/email/doctype/notification/notification.json:209
msgid "<p><strong>{{ __(\"Condition Examples\") }}:</strong></p>\n"
"<pre><code class=\"language-python\">doc.status==\"Open\"<br>doc.due_date==nowdate()<br>doc.total &gt; 40000\n"
"</code></pre>\n"
msgstr "<p><strong>{{ __(\"Condition Examples\") }}:</strong></p>\n"
"<pre><code class=\"language-python\">doc.status==\"Open\"<br>doc.due_date==nowdate()<br>doc.total &gt; 40000\n"
"</code></pre>\n"

#. Content of the 'html_condition' (HTML) field in DocType 'Webhook'
#: frappe/integrations/doctype/webhook/webhook.json:81
msgid "<p><strong>{{ __(\"Condition Examples\") }}:</strong></p>\n"
"<pre>doc.status==\"Open\"<br>doc.due_date==nowdate()<br>doc.total &gt; 40000\n"
"</pre>"
msgstr "<p><strong>{{ __(\"Condition Examples\") }}:</strong></p>\n"
"<pre>doc.status==\"Open\"<br>doc.due_date==nowdate()<br>doc.total &gt; 40000\n"
"</pre>"

#. Content of the 'Condition description' (HTML) field in DocType 'Web Form'
#: frappe/website/doctype/web_form/web_form.json:390
msgid "<p>Multiple webforms can be created for a single doctype. Add filters specific to this webform to display correct record after submission.</p><p>For Example:</p>\n"
"<p>If you create a separate webform every year to capture feedback from employees add a \n"
" field named year in doctype and add a filter <b>year = 2023</b></p>\n"
msgstr "<p>Vienai dokumento tipui galima sukurti kelias žiniatinklio formas. Pridėkite šiai žiniatinklio formai būdingus filtrus, kad pateikus būtų rodomas teisingas įrašas.</p><p>Pavyzdys:</p>\n"
"<p>Jei kiekvienais metais kuriate atskirą žiniatinklio formą darbuotojų atsiliepimams surinkti, į doctype įrašykite lauką pavadinimu metai ir pridėkite filtrą <b>year = 2023</b></p>\n"

#. Description of the 'Context Script' (Code) field in DocType 'Web Page'
#: frappe/website/doctype/web_page/web_page.json:308
msgid "<p>Set context before rendering a template. Example:</p><p>\n"
"</p><div><pre><code>\n"
"context.project = frappe.get_doc(\"Project\", frappe.form_dict.name)\n"
"</code></pre></div>"
msgstr "<p>Nustatykite kontekstą prieš atvaizduodami šabloną. Pavyzdys:</p><p>\n"
"</p><div><pre><code>\n"
"context.project = frappe.get_doc(\"Project\", frappe.form_dict.name)\n"
"</code></pre></div>"

#. Content of the 'JS Message' (HTML) field in DocType 'Custom HTML Block'
#: frappe/desk/doctype/custom_html_block/custom_html_block.json:72
msgid "<p>To interact with above HTML you will have to use `root_element` as a parent selector.</p><p>For example:</p><pre class=\"p-3 bg-gray-100 border-radius rounded-sm mb-0\" style=\"width: fit-content;\"><code>// here root_element is provided by default\n"
"let some_class_element = root_element.querySelector('.some-class');\n"
"some_class_element.textContent = \"New content\";\n"
"</code></pre>"
msgstr "<p>Tam, kad galėtumėte sąveikauti su pirmiau pateiktu HTML, turite naudoti `root_element` kaip pagrindinį selektorių.</p><p>Pavyzdys:</p><pre class=\"p-3 bg-gray-100 border-radius rounded-sm mb-0\" style=\"width: fit-content;\"><code>/// čia root_element pateikiamas pagal nutylėjimą\n"
"let some_class_element = root_element.querySelector('.some-class');\n"
"some_class_element.textContent = \"Naujas turinys\";\n"
"</code></pre>"

#: frappe/twofactor.py:452
#, python-brace-format
msgid "<p>Your OTP secret on {0} has been reset. If you did not perform this reset and did not request it, please contact your System Administrator immediately.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Jūsų OTP paslaptis {0} buvo iš naujo nustatyta. Jei šio atstatymo neatlikote ir jo neprašėte, nedelsdami kreipkitės į sistemos administratorių.</p>"

#. Description of the 'Cron Format' (Data) field in DocType 'Scheduled Job
#. Type'
#. Description of the 'Cron Format' (Data) field in DocType 'Server Script'
#: frappe/core/doctype/scheduled_job_type/scheduled_job_type.json:64
#: frappe/core/doctype/server_script/server_script.json:142
msgid "<pre>*  *  *  *  *\n"
"┬  ┬  ┬  ┬  ┬\n"
"│  │  │  │  │\n"
"│  │  │  │  └ day of week (0 - 6) (0 is Sunday)\n"
"│  │  │  └───── month (1 - 12)\n"
"│  │  └────────── day of month (1 - 31)\n"
"│  └─────────────── hour (0 - 23)\n"
"└──────────────────── minute (0 - 59)\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"* - Any value\n"
"/ - Step values\n"
"</pre>\n"
msgstr "<pre>*  *  *  *  *\n"
"┬  ┬  ┬  ┬  ┬\n"
"│  │  │  │  │\n"
"│  │  │  │  └ savaitės diena (0 - 6) (0 yra Sekmadienis)\n"
"│  │  │  └───── mėnesis (1 - 12)\n"
"│  │  └────────── mėnesio diena (1 - 31)\n"
"│  └─────────────── valanda (0 - 23)\n"
"└──────────────────── minutė (0 - 59)\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"* - bet kokia reikšmė\n"
